The theme data is from Visual Studio Code 1.143.0, commit
2d0b7506a36c1d6db9a466440131a8e01eab2289, installed locally in
/usr/share/code/resources/app/extensions/theme-defaults/themes/.
Upstream: https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/tree/2d0b7506a36c1d6db9a466440131a8e01eab2289/extensions/theme-defaults/themes

Includes are flattened in order: dark_vs.json, dark_plus.json,
dark_modern.json, 2026-dark.json. Original color values and ordered
TextMate rules are retained; source SHA-256 hashes are in the JSON.
Setdown maps those scopes to its existing Monaco/Prism token roles.
It does not install or emulate VS Code language extensions.
Terminal ANSI defaults follow VS Code terminalColorRegistry.ts.
